# 3D assets the fitting room LOADS are tracked: they are the product, not
# scratch. Excluding them meant every deploy had no avatar, the GLB request
# 404'd, and the error boundary quietly swapped in the procedural mannequin —
# so live visitors saw a wooden peg figure and no one knew why.
#
# Only genuinely unused binaries stay ignored.
# /public/models/**/*.glb        <- removed deliberately, see above
/public/models/**/*.gltf
/public/textures/**/*.ktx2
/public/models/scratch/
/public/models/**/*.fbx
/public/models/**/*.obj

# local dev artefacts
dev.log
*.log
